        Homebuyer Action Playbook: 60-Day Financial Cleanup
      </h2>
      
      <ol style="color: var(--premier-charcoal); padding-left: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.05rem;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
