        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <strong>Conduct a Subscription Audit:</strong> Review the app's recurring charges list. Cancel any streaming services, gym memberships, or software subscriptions you do not use regularly.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <strong>Set Up a Down Payment Vault:</strong> Configure an automated savings rule to transfer funds weekly into your home purchase deposit account.
        </li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <strong>Monitor Credit Utilization:</strong> Aim to keep revolving credit card balances below 30 percent (ideally under 10 percent) of your credit limits to optimize your credit score.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Prepare Bank Statements:</strong> Keep bank accounts clean and free of unusual transfers or cash deposits during the 60 to 90 days leading up to mortgage pre-approval.
        </li>
      </ol>
